{%- comment -%}
  robots.txt for Vital Socks (served at /robots.txt).

  It starts from Shopify's maintained default rules, output through the
  robots object, so Shopify's own SEO updates keep flowing in. Do not paste
  the rules in as plain text.

  The defaults already block /admin, /cart, /checkout, /account, internal
  search, sorted/filtered collection URLs and preview links, and they list
  the sitemap Shopify generates at /sitemap.xml.

  AI search crawlers (OAI-SearchBot, PerplexityBot, ClaudeBot,
  Google-Extended and others) are allowed through the '*' group. Don't give
  them their own group to "allow" them: a named group replaces the '*' rules
  for that bot, which would unblock cart and checkout pages for it.
{%- endcomment -%}
# Vital Socks - graded compression socks, South Africa
{% for group in robots.default_groups %}
  {{- group.user_agent -}}

  {% for rule in group.rules %}
    {{- rule -}}
  {% endfor %}

  {%- if group.sitemap != blank -%}
    {{ group.sitemap }}
  {%- endif -%}
{% endfor %}
